WEBVTT

00:05:26.746 --> 00:05:32.496
I'd love to talk to you a little bit
about how you have navigated

00:05:32.496 --> 00:05:37.329
the arc of your life. You were born Cheryl
Niland in Spangler, Pennsylvania.

00:05:37.371 --> 00:05:41.121
Yeah. And moved to Chaska, Minnesota,
when you were six years old.

00:05:41.746 --> 00:05:44.329
Shortly thereafter, your
parents got divorced.

00:05:44.329 --> 00:05:47.288
And in addition to the time
after your mother died,

00:05:47.288 --> 00:05:52.996
it seems as if those years were some of
the darkest years of your life. Mm hmm.

00:05:53.163 --> 00:05:55.079
Did you realize that at the time?

00:05:56.204 --> 00:05:57.579
Gosh, that's such a great question.

00:05:57.621 --> 00:06:04.371
I did I did realize it to the extent that
a child can, which is somewhat limited.